{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">High-speed single-button platformer where precise timing is key. Switch gravity through twisted levels that will put your reflexes to the test.  Includes single player story mode and competitive local multiplayer for <strong>up to 8 players</strong>. Easily create and publish your own levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505960/extras/endless_run_loop.gif?t=1742921904\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenging single-player <strong>story mode</strong> with 8 levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Competitive local multiplayer mode for up to <strong>8 players</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create and share your own levels in the intuitive <strong>level editor</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Thousands</strong> of single-player and multiplayer user levels to play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Full gamepad, keyboard and mouse</strong> support\u00a0\u2014 mix and match in multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seamless profile creation with Steam login (Discord merge available)</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3505960?t=1742921904","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505960/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742921904","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505960/aa040e9804cf9ab81dbfcdde3078b2c94f052d01/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742921904","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505960/aa040e9804cf9ab81dbfcdde3078b2c94f052d01/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742921904","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"descr